ser`).  \n\n---\n\n7. ', '|Case|:search_for_note  \nProject Code Implementation (Pseudocode):  \n```python\nFUNCTION search()  \n    IF \'username\' NOT IN session  \n        REDIRECT to login  \n    ELSE  \n        query = request.args.get(\'query\', \'\')  \n        results = data_handler.search_notes(session[\'username\'], query)  \n        RENDER search.html WITH query=query, results=results  \n    ENDIF  \nEND FUNCTION  \n```\nKey Functionality:  \n- Searches notes by title/content (case-insensitive).  \n\n---\n\n8. |Case|:navigate_back_to_dashboard  \nProject Code Implementation (Pseudocode):  \n```python\nFUNCTION search()  \n    ... (same as above)  \nEND FUNCTION  \n\n<!-- search.html -->  \n<a href="/dashboard">Back to Dashboard</a>  \n```\nKey Functionality:  \n- Simple navigation via hyperlinks.  \n\n---\n\n9. ', "|Case|:logout  \nProject Code Implementation (Pseudocode):  \n```python\nFUNCTION logout()  \n    session.pop('username', None)  \n    REDIRECT to login  \nEND FUNCTION  \n```\nKey Functionality:  \n- Clears session and redirects to login.  \n\n---"]
